working.

21
00:00:51.847 --> 00:00:54.792
Owner identifiers and renewal rules help
manage leases

22
00:00:54.792 --> 00:00:57.553
but do not automatically stop stale
writes.

23
00:00:57.553 --> 00:01:00.129
Fencing uses ordered ownership tokens that
the

24
00:01:00.129 --> 00:01:02.890
