25
00:01:02.890 --> 00:01:06.387
That check must be enforced with the
protected operation.

26
00:01:06.387 --> 00:01:08.779
Network partitions, process failures, and
renewal

27
00:01:08.779 --> 00:01:10.804
failures belong in the design.

28
00:01:10.804 --> 00:01:14.668
Prefer simpler storage guarantees when
they express the invariant directly.

29
00:01:14.668 --> 00:01:16.693
Tests should create overlap deliberately.

30
00:01:16.693 --> 00:01:19.638
Start multiple attempts against the same
resource and

31
00:01:19.638 --> 00:01:23.134
