processes.

34
00:01:27.183 --> 00:01:30.128
A test that accidentally shares one
serialized connection

35
00:01:30.128 --> 00:01:32.889
may exercise far less concurrency than
production.

36
00:01:32.889 --> 00:01:37.213
Sleeps can vary timing, but should not be
the only mechanism.

37
00:01:37.213 --> 00:01:41.538
Wait for all attempts to settle, then
inspect authoritative final state.

38
00:01:41.538 --> 00:01:44.575
For one available unit, verify the
quantity and

39
00:01:44.575 --> 00:01:48.164
