just response codes.

40
00:01:48.164 --> 00:01:52.029
Rejected or conflicting attempts must
leave no unintended partial effect.

41
00:01:52.029 --> 00:01:54.789
Test duplicate messages, stale edits,
timeouts after

42
00:01:54.789 --> 00:01:57.642
commit, and recovery after a worker stops.

43
00:01:57.642 --> 00:02:00.679
Repeat targeted schedules and review
read-check-write gaps, non-atomic

44
00:02:00.679 --> 00:02:03.531
counters, local flags, and unguarded
retries; a

45
00:02:03.531 --> 00:02:06.660
